AB  - Southern Cross Health Society launched an AI-powered digital assistant called ‘Aimee’ using UneeQ’s Intelligent Digital Human Platform to help people find information about health insurance and empower members with 24/7 support. The digital human is designed to provide empathetic, easy-to-understand responses about insurance and health system questions, with long-term enhancement through machine learning. 
KW  - Artificial intelligence; Digital human; Health insurance; Southern Cross Health Society; Customer support; Innovation
